# Nothing here needs to travel to the build machine: Vercel installs
# dependencies and runs `next build` itself, so uploading the local results of
# both is pure transfer cost. Without this the CLI was packing ~168 MB and the
# upload was failing partway.
#
# .next-dev is this project's dev-server output directory (next.config.ts
# splits dev and production dist dirs so a dev server and a production server
# can share one checkout) — it is doubly irrelevant to a deploy.

node_modules
.next
.next-dev
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local env and Vercel link state
.env*.local
.vercel

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
